  illustration: {fileID: 21300000, guid: e904ba38a91cbcd4e82e14641e6e118d, type: 3}
  storyText: "As everything is falling apart, an ancient guardian appears and leaves
    Leo one final message:\n\u201COnly when the three lands are freed from the forces
    of evil can the World Core be restored.\u201D\nIt is the last hope left in the
    world. In that moment, Leo realizes he cannot simply stand by and do nothing.
    If no one takes action, Hopix will disappear forever."
